{"completed": true, "response": "<escape>{\n  \"better\": \"X\",\n  \"regress\": \"有：X在心理因果的交代上不如Y直白，尤其S10—S11，Y更清楚地说明了为什么舍不得、为什么仍不回去，以及为什么决定先把眼下过稳。\",\n  \"nets\": {\n    \"scan\": \"X\",\n    \"point\": \"X\",\n    \"why\": \"Y\",\n    \"whole\": \"X\",\n    \"fine\": \"X\"\n  },\n  \"why\": \"X的优势是叙事锚点突出，话语短而有重点，感受又能跟随音乐分时出现，观众不必一直读长句，也能抓住人物从离开后的空落、怀念、动摇到重新站稳的变化。它的音乐感受尤其细腻，既写情绪，也写声音、动作和情绪之间的转化，舞步、祈祷、摇篮曲等意象还形成了前后呼应。Y的心理解释更完整，但部分长句在短时段里不容易扫完，右栏也有一些信息空缺；综合实际观看体验，我选X。\"\n}</escape>", "metadata": {"session_handle": "b4c6e190-a81b-49cb-ab83-934a68487553", "session_revision": 0, "session_ttl_max_hours": 6, "job_directory": "D:\\musicclaude\\gpt2agent-safechain\\runs\\gpt4\\pro-bridge-20261106T232057900565Z", "elapsed_seconds": 69.265, "completed_utc": "2026-11-06T23:22:07.183304+00:00", "model": "gpt-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "temporary": true, "unpersonalized": true, "generation_policy_verified": true, "request_policy": {"model": "gpt-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "history_and_training_disabled": true, "temporary_chat_requests_personalization": false, "is_do_not_remember": false, "continuation": false, "unpersonalized_inherited_verified": false, "body_sha256": "8ee517692277b366f1476c20a07e7f63a413acb0bc3cb8ac25a681e914e2f67b", "attachment_count": 0}, "stream_completion": {"sse_done": true, "message_completed": true, "independent_terminal_verified": true}, "profile": "Nozomi Kasaki / gpt4", "account_sha256": "bbd4fd636d4b6714d2b42b89e341bdb5bbe7c34f7d141aec76b444be8343fe54", "transport": "probridge-pure-http", "resume_requests": 0, "topic_connections": 0, "browser_started": false, "Docker_used": false, "automatic_retry": false, "initializer_pss_limit_mib": "not_applicable_no_browser", "attachment_count": 0, "code_sha256": {"tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_cli.py": "96a4cdb6cd5d982f4d1de5b6ba8fae0cf23ee44aa3e41d7fdf6968e3fb590e48", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_sessions.py": "83a3ed4ae1efa9f1a2b8ee3f144cc0dc9f668f995a33cc4222308cb3fa31f683", "tools\\chatgpt_we